OL,8,     FSteven, 66, has severe stomach
OL,9,     Fcramps. And 16-year-old Aaliyah's
OL,10,     Ffingernail has been badly damaged
OL,11,     Fin a fight.
OL,12,G0110 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FJunior, who's eight, has been
OL,14,     Fknocked off his bike by a car. He
OL,15,     Fhas an open leg fracture and
OL,16,     Fsuspected internal bleeding.
OL,17,     FMeanwhile, Anthony has a
OL,18,     Fdangerously high heart rate.
